  "description": "Multi-tenancy and distributed coordination library for .NET containerised backends. Provides tenant context resolution (JWT / header / route), PostgreSQL-native leader election with fencing tokens, task outbox with SKIP LOCKED, event outbox with at-least-once delivery, inbox idempotency, distributed cache, token-bucket rate limiter, circuit breaker, CRDTs, and saga orchestration — zero Redis, zero Zookeeper. Schema is created automatically on startup.",
